rnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2018 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2018-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David M. Sagehorn","x":"We estimate corporate expenses will be $145 million to $150 million, lower than 2018 due to cost reduction efforts and expected lower incentive compensation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/oshkosh-corp-osk-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2019-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David M. Sagehorn","x":"And we were coming out with the most significant price increases we've ever introduced into the Access markets and we knew those were going to be tough negotiations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2019-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wilson R. Jones","x":"So, price increase was -- it doesn't appear there was a pull forward there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2019-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David M. Sagehorn","x":"So, we did call out some of those last year, Tim, and actually we moved some of those to non-GAAP, because it was related to the overall restructuring program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2019-01-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wilson R. Jones","x":"This positive customer sentiment drives our increased outlook for 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q2","e":"osk","d":"2019-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wilson R. Jones","x":"Like many companies, we are dealing with challenges related to uncertain trade policies and tariffs, labor challenges, weather and other macro factors that impact each of our segments differently.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q2","e":"osk","d":"2019-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David M. Sagehorn","x":"We saw more non-steel cost escalation this quarter as expected, but that escalation was offset by a price increase that was effective January 1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q2","e":"osk","d":"2019-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wilson R. Jones","x":"That's our normal price increase, so there was part of it related to that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David M Sagehorn","x":"But we're also hearing about steel mills out there putting out price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/oshkosh-corp-osk-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Stanley Elliott","x":"And then the restructuring and simplification has had a big impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/oshkosh-corp-osk-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mircea Dobre","x":"Is it now fair for us to expect some kind of restructuring program as you're managing your production volumes going forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/oshkosh-corp-osk-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2019-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wilson Jones","x":"We successfully navigated the impacts of volatile trade policy and tariffs along with talk of an impending recession.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/oshkosh-corp-osk-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2019-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Sagehorn","x":"We expect to continued flat to slow growth fire truck market in North America in 2020 and slower international activity especially in Asia if the trade war drags on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/oshkosh-corp-osk-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Neil Frohnapple","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/oshkosh-corp-osk-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2019 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ann Duignan","x":"My first question is on the access business you had imposed surcharges, not list price increases when steel prices rose.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/oshkosh-corp-osk-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2020 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2020-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David M. Sagehorn","x":"These were partially offset by positive pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/oshkosh-corp-osk-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2020 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Stanley Elliott","x":"And then with the lot of the restructuring you've done over the past several years, could you remind us again on what sort of a detrimental margin would look like kind of on a go forward basis under kind of the current framework?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/oshkosh-corp-osk-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2020 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2020-01-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wilson R. Jones","x":"We reaffirmed our outlook for 2020, which includes expectations for solid earnings per share in the year when demand in our largest segment will be down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/oshkosh-corp-osk-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2020 Q2","e":"osk","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wilson R. Jones","x":"And we've implemented salary reductions, furloughs and other cost reduction actions across the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/oshkosh-corp-osk-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2020 Q2","e":"osk","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wilson R. Jones","x":"These cost reduction actions include salary reductions, furloughs, temporary plant shutdowns, limiting travel and reducing project costs and other discretionary spending.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/oshkosh-corp-osk-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2020 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2020-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sean McMahon","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2020 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Pack","x":"However, strong execution by our teams, combined with rapid implementation of cost reduction actions allowed us to effectively manage the business and deliver solid adjusted consolidated decremental margins of 15.9% for the quarter on a significant decrease in year-over-year sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2020 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Pack","x":"Fire & emergency third quarter adjusted operating income declined due to lower sales volume and adverse sales mix, largely offset by improved pricing, lower incentive compensation expense, and the benefit of temporary cost reduction actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"OSK 2020 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"We've taken both temporary and permanent cost reduction actions in the business as we weather the storm.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2020 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"On our last call, we announced restructuring plans to transfer rear discharge concrete mixer production from Minnesota to Ontario, Canada as the team simplifies the business with a focused factory approach.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/oshkosh-corp-osk-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2021-01-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chad Dillard","x":"Do you expect positive growth and net price realization in Access?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/oshkosh-corp-osk-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2021-01-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chad Dillard","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/oshkosh-corp-osk-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2021-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael E. Pack","x":"During our last earnings call, we discussed an $85 million pre-tax cost headwind we expect to face in 2021, consisting of $120 million of temporary cost reductions in 2020, returning in 2021, offset by approximately $35 million of permanent cost reduction benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/oshkosh-corp-osk-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q2","e":"osk","d":"2021-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Ann Duignan","x":"Most of my questions have been answered, but I am curious, back in 2018, I believe, that you introduced a price increase tariff, not a full price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/oshkosh-corp-osk-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q2","e":"osk","d":"2021-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Ann Duignan","x":"Or can you just explain the rationale for tariffs versus price increase?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/oshkosh-corp-osk-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q2","e":"osk","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"Steel prices remain at record highs, and we took further actions during the quarter to mitigate the risk, including additional cost locks on portions of our planned steel purchases as well as price increases for new units ordered beginning in early March.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/oshkosh-corp-osk-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q2","e":"osk","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"Much like we experienced in 2018 when steel costs increased significantly, there will be a lag in the benefit until we work through orders that were in our backlog prior to the price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/oshkosh-corp-osk-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2021-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"And you see it like the pierce full tariff first ever electric fire truck, and it's actually been on hundreds and hundreds of live runs and performing extremely well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/oshkosh-corporation-osk-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael E. Pack","x":"And back in the second quarter, we implemented price increases in our non-Defense businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/oshkosh-corporation-osk-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael E. Pack","x":"In some cases, we've implemented additional price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/oshkosh-corporation-osk-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael E. Pack","x":"As a reminder, we benefited from approximately $60 million of temporary cost reduction actions as a result of the pandemic during last year's third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/oshkosh-corporation-osk-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"Some examples of the actions include: implementing multiple price increases in the last several months in our non-defense segments to mitigate cost inflation; redesigning many of our JLG products to accept higher capability microprocessors, which are produced in higher quantities by chip makers…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/oshkosh-corporation-osk-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"OSK 2021 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael E. Pack","x":"We believe these price increases will enable us to achieve price/cost equilibrium but will still need to -- but we still need to work through large backlogs, so will take until the end of the second quarter of 2022 for these pricing actions to largely catch up with cost escalation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/oshkosh-corporation-osk-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"But we are seeing customers be more cautious in the near term regarding new equipment purchases as a result of tariffs and the current economic environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/oshkosh-osk-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"In the near term, the team remains resilient and is working to mitigate the impacts of tariffs across our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/oshkosh-osk-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"We are also having initial discussions with customers regarding the impact of tariffs on pricing with the expectation that we will raise prices in 2026 to keep pace with input costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/oshkosh-osk-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"Now you can't mitigate everything, so that's why I said in my prepared remarks that there'll be some price increase in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/oshkosh-osk-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"In recent quarters, we've seen an increase in the mix of orders for Build My Pierce pumpers, which should further support our efforts to streamline production and reduce lead times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/oshkosh-osk-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2026-01-29","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"John Pfeifer","x":"Lastly, through an immersive theater experience, we demonstrated how our equipment and technology, including the autonomous jet dock, modular runway robots, and IOPS software, work together in any weather to deliver the perfect turn for airlines, airports, and travelers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/oshkosh-osk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2026-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Pfeifer","x":"As we have discussed on prior calls, the team pulled together across the company to respond to the evolving tariff landscape.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/oshkosh-osk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2026-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Matthew Field","x":"Adjusted operating income margin of 8.8% reflected unfavorable price cost dynamics including about $20 million of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/oshkosh-osk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2026-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Pfeifer","x":"Our access team managed through challenges to finish the year on a high note with fourth quarter revenue of $1.2 billion roughly equal to last year and a higher than the third quarter as we benefited from strong demand in advance of 2026 price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/oshkosh-osk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2026-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Field","x":"We believe that the announced 2026 tariff-related price increases for access products contributed to stronger sales performance in the fourth quarter compared to our most recent guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/oshkosh-osk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2026-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Field","x":"So on the cost side, I'll give kudos to the access team, which really kicked off a cost reduction initiative going all the way back to 2024, and that progressively has results And so they're continuing to identify cost savings throughout this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/oshkosh-osk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2025 Q4","e":"osk","d":"2026-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Field","x":"So cost savings are kind of grow cumulatively quarter over quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/oshkosh-osk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2026 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2026-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"You are correct, we are dealing with a very dynamic environment, both with tariffs and geopolitical conflict, which creates inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/oshkosh-osk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2026 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2026-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Matthew Allen Field","x":"We are assuming the present tariff landscape continues throughout the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/oshkosh-osk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2026 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2026-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"And we will get more cost reduction to minimize how much price we have to get as we go through the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/oshkosh-osk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2026 Q1","e":"osk","d":"2026-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John C. Pfeifer","x":"Then you look at the work that we are doing to right-size our capacity to be able to deliver that— that is the confidence that we have in 2028.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/oshkosh-osk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2026 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Matt Field","x":"The solid adjusted OI margin also reflected roughly neutral price cost with improved pricing, largely offsetting higher tariff costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/oshkosh-osk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2026 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Matt Field","x":"While we are seeing improved demand in production efficiencies, we continue to manage a dynamic external economic and tariff environment that is impacting raw material prices and freight costs, which is reflected in this margin outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/oshkosh-osk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2026 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tami Zakaria","x":"Or did those orders already have escalators such that it would not have to go back and reprice, and it would just pass through?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/oshkosh-osk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSK 2026 Q3","e":"osk","d":"2026-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Pfeifer","x":"We, of course, take cost out through a lot of work that we have done from tariff engineering to sourcing and other total cost management efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/oshkosh-osk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,11010,0,0,0,8029,2233],[36,1,10208,0,0,0,7180,2222],[37,1,9308,0,0,0,7303,1463],[38,1,8399,0,0,0,6670,1226],[39,1,10893,0,0,0,8127,2174],[40,1,11664,0,0,0,8076,2749],[41,1,10558,0,0,0,7867,2031],[42,1,11246,0,0,0,8716,2027],[43,1,9894,0,0,0,8170,1219],[44,1,12844,0,0,0,9638,2470],[45,1,9394,0,0,0,7585,1400],[46,1,8989,0,0,0,7013,1526],[47,1,8113,0,0,0,6664,1090],[63,1,7332,0,0,0,6048,957],[